bundle_*/
pbs_bundle_*/

# Generated figures + presentations (regenerate with docs/figures/build_*.py)
docs/figures/*.png
docs/architecture_slides.pptx

# Locally-built search indexes — NEVER commit (a committed LFS index broke
# `uv tool install`; the repo ships code only, indexes are built via
# `apecx-setup rag` / scripts/build_*_index.py). See docs/no_github_data_2026-05-22.md.
data/faiss_indexes/
data/apecx_domain_rag/
*.faiss
*.pkl
tests/eval/output/
